    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天是星期几？我怎么了？",
      "traditional": "今天是星期幾？我怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì xīng qī jǐ wǒ zěn me le",
      "english": "What day is it today? What happened to me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "那天，大猫打我。我很冷，我不能说话了，也不能走了。",
      "traditional": "那天，大貓打我。我很冷，我不能說話了，也不能走了。",
      "pinyin": "nà tiān dà māo dǎ wǒ wǒ hěn lěng wǒ bù néng shuō huà le yě bù néng zǒu le",
      "english": "That day, the big cat hit me. I was very cold, I couldn’t speak, and I couldn’t walk."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "现在呢？我现在不冷了，我好了吗？",
      "traditional": "現在呢？我現在不冷了，我好了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài ne wǒ xiàn zài bù lěng le wǒ hǎo le ma",
      "english": "What about now? I wasn’t cold now. Was I better?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“饭饭？”我叫饭饭的名字。太好了！我能说话了！",
      "traditional": "“飯飯？”我叫飯飯的名字。太好了！我能說話了！",
      "pinyin": "fàn fàn wǒ jiào fàn fàn de míng zi tài hǎo le wǒ néng shuō huà le",
      "english": "“Fanfan?” I called Fanfan’s name. Great! I can speak!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“饭饭？”我找饭饭。太好了！我也能走了！",
      "traditional": "“飯飯？”我找飯飯。太好了！我也能走了！",
      "pinyin": "fàn fàn wǒ zhǎo fàn fàn tài hǎo le wǒ yě néng zǒu le",
      "english": "“Fanfan?” I was looking for Fanfan. Great! I can walk!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“饭饭？”饭饭怎么了？饭饭去哪儿了？他不见了！",
      "traditional": "“飯飯？”飯飯怎麼了？飯飯去哪兒了？他不見了！",
      "pinyin": "fàn fàn fàn fàn zěn me le fàn fàn qù nǎ'r le tā bú jiàn le",
      "english": "“Fanfan?” What happened to Fanfan? Where did Fanfan go? He disappeared!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "这是哪儿？这儿不是学校，不是饭店，不是商店，也不是医院。",
      "traditional": "這是哪兒？這兒不是學校，不是飯店，不是商店，也不是醫院。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì nǎ'r zhè‘r bú shì xué xiào bú shì fàn diàn bú shì shāng diàn yě bú shì yī yuàn",
      "english": "Where was this place? It wasn’t the school, it wasn’t the restaurant, it wasn’t the store, and it wasn’t the hospital."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
